<!-- WHAT MAKES A STRONG SESSION -->
<section>
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-20 lg:py-24">
        <h2 class="section-title max-w-3xl text-[2.3rem]">What Makes a Strong DLF Forum Session?</h2>

        <div class="mt-10 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3 lg:gap-7">

            <div class="surface-card rounded-[1.6rem] p-6 md:p-7">
                <h3 class="font-headline text-[1.35rem] leading-tight tracking-[-0.025em]">Participatory</h3>
                <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-gray-600">
                    Sessions should actively involve participants through discussion, collaboration, and shared exploration.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="surface-card rounded-[1.6rem] p-6 md:p-7">
                <h3 class="font-headline text-[1.35rem] leading-tight tracking-[-0.025em]">Inclusive</h3>
                <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-gray-600">
                    Welcome diverse perspectives, experience levels, and institutional contexts.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="surface-card rounded-[1.6rem] p-6 md:p-7">
                <h3 class="font-headline text-[1.35rem] leading-tight tracking-[-0.025em]">Action-Oriented</h3>
                <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-gray-600">
                    Provide clear takeaways participants can apply in their own work.
                </p>
            </div>

        </div>

        <p class="mt-8 max-w-3xl text-[1.02rem] leading-8 text-gray-700">
            We also welcome presentations from the commercial sector that contribute
            knowledge, lessons learned, and community value rather than promoting specific products.
        </p>
    </div>
</section>

